{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a7a2005b67ab81ee5ff231b2f370f1d71ebe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, which of the following has the largest value?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4ea4b3cceef936c5e151147c327ffa3de3e71d0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\sqrt{x} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{x}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ x - 5 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{40}{x} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\frac{x^{2}}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"468\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a7a2005b67ab81ee5ff231b2f370f1d71ebe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> into each answer choice and then see which is the greatest value:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/4862fadfb120a13a3301ca2028bf9eb3fc75b696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/9/869c29929ec9810b60950dc8b0fb74b7e3689ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2} = 4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f31af8c16cb41cdc8bb9a8cefa94623719ecf7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 - 5 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e49eef5f76125d11434f7770825a794d1baefe9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{9} = 4.\\overline{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/0093d1b822bb21514a14135cd140cfcfb09e057c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9^{2}}{20} = \\frac{81}{20} = 4.05$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>We could have also noted that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/2/b829ebde0cd4787c6e4b3e8a50fc18401121489a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{81}{20} = \\frac{8.1}{2} &lt; \\frac{9}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />. Of the answer choices, the one with the largest value when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/a/04a7a2005b67ab81ee5ff231b2f370f1d71ebe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e2389779c479f040ab04b39a0eecbd68d6600807.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } \\frac{x}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"46\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_K